    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "bc0e946acbad77fb59329d1254c851ab4ebb16c909bc57c714623729c476297e",
      "text": "The day begins with a visit to a cacao plantation. You will learn how chocolate is made, from planting cacao and harvesting, drying and grinding the beans to preparing hot chocolate.\n\nAfter the chocolate tour, take a walk on the slopes of Arenal Volcano.\n\nLava from the powerful 1968 eruption shaped parts of the landscape between the volcano and the rainforest. Follow the Los Tucanes trail with your guide and see the vegetation of the national park.\n\nThe main itinerary includes an evening folk show with traditional costumes, sketches, sets, dances and songs about Costa Rica.\n\nAs an alternative to the main itinerary for this day, you can choose a full-day excursion to the Monteverde cloud forest.\n\n**excursion_costa_rica_monteverde_viento_fresco_day_trip**\n\nThe excursion lasts about 12 hours and starts early in the morning.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-translator-20261109-mw9q1icj-eexlx1dza",
        "model": "GPT-6"
